    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are PLAYER_</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the BOARD needs to solve the case of the missing DEVELOPERS.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An abandonware_\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_will be your place of investigation. Explore the game, find clues, search the rooms and finish the tasks. Some will be simple, others will require sharp eyes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stuff to do_ </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_How much stuff? You don't know. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember not to get overwhelmed.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the DEVICE, your GESTURES and other OBJECTS. Did you leave something behind? Maybe, and it is that doubt the one that will alter your perception. Your vision will change and so will the space. Some things might appear out of nowhere, or maybe it is just your mind playing tricks. Who knows? Your perception will be tested and new things could be lurking around you. Just remember to breathe and... <strong>Check your pulse</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What will happen to you?:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click movement inspired by classics like Myst.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro style. Less is more and here the atmosphere demands it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental minimalist gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-jumpscare horror with an emphasis on environment and narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with unease in order to create an experience intended to be finished in under two hours. Maybe more, maybe less. Who knows how deep the rabbit hole goes.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are PLAYER_</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the BOARD needs to solve the case of the missing DEVELOPERS.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An abandonware_\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_will be your place of investigation. Explore the game, find clues, search the rooms and finish the tasks. Some will be simple, others will require sharp eyes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stuff to do_ </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_How much stuff? You don't know. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember not to get overwhelmed.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the DEVICE, your GESTURES and other OBJECTS. Did you leave something behind? Maybe, and it is that doubt the one that will alter your perception. Your vision will change and so will the space. Some things might appear out of nowhere, or maybe it is just your mind playing tricks. Who knows? Your perception will be tested and new things could be lurking around you. Just remember to breathe and... <strong>Check your pulse</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What will happen to you?:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click movement inspired by classics like Myst.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro style. Less is more and here the atmosphere demands it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental minimalist gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-jumpscare horror with an emphasis on environment and narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with unease in order to create an experience intended to be finished in under two hours. Maybe more, maybe less. Who knows how deep the rabbit hole goes.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Investigate an abandoned game to unravel the whereabouts of its developers. Do stuff. Check your pulse. Escape the rabbit hole.",
